{"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOLinearProgressIndicator"}],"title":"MISOLinearProgressIndicator","externalID":"s:14MISOComponents27MISOLinearProgressIndicatorV","roleHeading":"Structure","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MISOLinearProgressIndicator","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"macOS"},{"unavailable":false,"name":"tvOS","introducedAt":"16.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"1.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"name":"watchOS","introducedAt":"11.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false}]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misolinearprogressindicator"]}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLinearProgressIndicator","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A linear indicator shows the progress of a task using a horizontal line."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It can show a specific value (determinate) or just that something is in progress (indeterminate)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Best used inside layouts to show progress.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLinearProgressIndicator\/init(progress:status:track:stopIndicator:helperText:gapSize:animated:accessibility:)","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLinearProgressIndicator\/init(status:track:helperText:helperTextAlignment:gapSize:accessibility:)"],"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLinearProgressIndicator\/body"],"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"anchor":"Enumerations","title":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLinearProgressIndicator\/HelperTextAlignment","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLinearProgressIndicator\/HelperTextType"],"generated":true},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLinearProgressIndicator\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLinearProgressIndicator\/View-Implementations"]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"MISOLinearProgressIndicator","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/Indicators"],"kind":"mentions"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Variants","text":"Variants"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Two variants are provided:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Determinate","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": the caller provides a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"type":"text","text":" value in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"[0, 1]"},{"type":"text","text":". Values outside this range are coerced."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Shows the exact progress of a task, usually as a percentage from 0% to 100%."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Provides clear and measurable feedback, helping users understand how long the task will take and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reducing uncertainty."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Use determinate indicators whenever possible. Avoid indeterminate when progress can be measured, e.g."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when the progress value is known (file upload, installation, data sync) or when the system can estimate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"completion time or percentage."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Indeterminate","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": no "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"type":"text","text":" is provided and the indicator loops continuously."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Shows that a process is active without indicating exact progress."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Used when the system cannot determine how long the task will take."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Communicates that the system is working, even without precise data, and prevents users from thinking"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"the interface is frozen.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For long loading times (over 5 seconds), additional context must be provided.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"anchor":"Statuses","text":"Statuses","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Neutral"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": default status used when progress has no specific semantic meaning. Suitable for generic"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"loading, processing, synchronization or background tasks."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Accent"}]},{"type":"text","text":": used to highlight primary or brand-related actions (uploads, downloads, installations,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"onboarding).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Positive"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": indicates successful progress or a process leading to a successful outcome.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Info"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": indicates informational or system-related processes (background synchronization, data","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"retrieval).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Warning","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": indicates progress related to an operation that requires user attention or should be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"monitored.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Negative"}]},{"type":"text","text":": indicates progress related to an error, recovery, cancellation or failure."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"text":"Gap size","anchor":"Gap-size","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"default"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": standard gap between the bar and the track (base Android Material 3 specification).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"small","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": reduced gap for a more compact appearance."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"text":"Track","anchor":"Track","type":"heading"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" (default): the track is displayed. Recommended when the indicator is shown on its own and needs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a clear structure. The track helps define the full range of progress and makes the value easier to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"read."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"text":": the track is hidden. Recommended when the indicator is embedded inside another component","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(button, tag, toast) or when a more minimal appearance is needed.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"text":"Stop indicator (determinate only)","type":"heading","anchor":"Stop-indicator-determinate-only","level":2},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":" (default): no stop indicator is drawn."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":": a small square (or dot if the theme uses rounded caps) is drawn at the end of the track to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"identify the end of the range easily. Required by accessibility criteria when the track has a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"contrast below 3:1 with its container or the surface behind the container."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The stop indicator is only available on the determinate variant, matching the Android Material 3"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specification: the indeterminate variant has no meaningful end position for it."}]},{"text":"Helper text","type":"heading","anchor":"Helper-text","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An optional text displayed below the progress bar to provide context or additional information."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"determinate"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" mode, use "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLinearProgressIndicator\/HelperTextType","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" which offers two variants:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".description(_:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Displays a simple description text without the progress percentage.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"alignment"},{"text":" parameter controls horizontal alignment (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".center"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".start"},{"text":", or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".end"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":".percent(description:alignment:)","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Displays the progress percentage with an optional description."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The percentage value and its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"%"},{"type":"text","text":" symbol are assembled through the localized wording key"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"core_progressIndicator_percent_value"},{"type":"text","text":", so the symbol, its spacing and its position follow the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"typographic rules of the current language (e.g. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"75%\""},{"type":"text","text":" in English, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"75 %\""},{"type":"text","text":" in French, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"٪75\""},{"type":"text","text":" in Arabic)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"alignment"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":".center","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (default), only the percentage is shown, centered.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"code":"alignment","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"code":".start","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", the percentage is at the leading edge and the description (if provided) at the trailing edge."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"alignment"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".end"},{"type":"text","text":", the description (if provided) is at the leading edge and the percentage at the trailing edge."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"indeterminate"}]},{"type":"text","text":" mode, the "},{"code":"helperText","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter is a simple "},{"code":"String?","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with a separate "},{"code":"helperTextAlignment","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".center"}]},{"text":" (default): The text is centered under the progress bar.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".start"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": The text is aligned to the leading edge."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".end"}]},{"text":": The text is aligned to the trailing edge.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Animation","text":"Animation"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Determinate"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": when "},{"code":"animated","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (default), the indicator progressively fills from "},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the target "},{"code":"progress","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" on first display and animates any subsequent change of "},{"code":"progress","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(based on Android Material 3 specifications). When "},{"code":"animated","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", the indicator is displayed instantly at its target value with no animation."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Indeterminate"}]},{"text":": the Android Material 3 two-line animation is intrinsic to the mode and cannot be disabled from the call site; there is no ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"animated"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parameter on the indeterminate initializer."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Animations are always disabled and a static bar filled at 70% is displayed when either","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"accessibilityReduceMotion","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or Low Power Mode is enabled.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Code-samples","type":"heading","text":"Code samples","level":2},{"anchor":"Determinate-Basic-usage","type":"heading","text":"Determinate — Basic usage","level":3},{"type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ Determinate — default (neutral, with track, default gap, reveal animation)","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75)","","    \/\/ Determinate with an accent status, no track and a helper text","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.5,","                                status: .accent,","                                track: false,","                                helperText: .description(\"Uploading…\"))","","    \/\/ Description aligned to the end","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.5, helperText: .description(\"Uploading...\", alignment: .end))","","    \/\/ Percentage centered (default)","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75, helperText: .percent())","","    \/\/ Percentage with description at start (percentage leading, description trailing)","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75,","                                helperText: .percent(description: \"of 100 MB\", alignment: .start))","","    \/\/ Indeterminate","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(status: .info)","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(status: .accent, helperText: \"Processing…\")","","    \/\/ Helper text aligned to the end","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(status: .info,","                                helperText: \"Loading data…\",","                                helperTextAlignment: .end)","","    \/\/ Determinate with accessibility name and state for VoiceOver","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75,","                                accessibility: .init(name: \"download bar\", state: \"downloading\"))","","    \/\/ Determinate with accessibility and helper text","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.5,","                                accessibility: .init(name: \"progress bar\", state: \"step 1 of 4\"),","                                helperText: .description(\"Loading...\"))","","    \/\/ Indeterminate with accessibility","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(status: .info,","                                accessibility: .init(name: \"loading\", state: \"processing\"))"],"syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","type":"heading","text":"Accessibility considerations","level":2},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibility"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter to provide a custom name and state for VoiceOver:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibility.name"},{"type":"text","text":": The name of the component (e.g., “progress bar”, “download bar”)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"accessibility.state","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": The state of the component (e.g., “downloading”, “step 1 of 4”)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"VoiceOver reads: ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"[name]. [state]. [helperText] [value]","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":". Example: ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"“download bar. downloading. 75 percent”","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibility"},{"type":"text","text":" is not provided, the behavior is unchanged: only the helper text (if provided) is used as label."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"determinate"}]},{"type":"text","text":" mode, the view exposes the current progress as an accessibility value (percentage)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so that Voice Over reads e.g. "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"“75 percent”"}]},{"type":"text","text":", and is marked with the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".updatesFrequently"},{"type":"text","text":" trait so that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"assistive technologies know the value is changing. If a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"helperText"},{"type":"text","text":" is provided, it is exposed as the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"accessibility label (Voice Over reads e.g. "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"“Uploading. 75 percent”"}]},{"type":"text","text":")."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The indicator never captures ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Full Keyboard Access"}]},{"text":" focus, as no interaction is possible on a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"progress indicator. On iOS 17+ \/ macOS 14+ \/ visionOS 1+ \/ watchOS 10+ \/ tvOS 17+, this is enforced","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"via ","type":"text"},{"code":"accessibilityRespondsToUserInteraction(false)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"; on earlier OS versions, the semantic","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".isStaticText"},{"text":" trait is used.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"indeterminate"}]},{"type":"text","text":" mode without helper text, the view is hidden from Voice Over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".accessibilityHidden(true)"},{"type":"text","text":") — and therefore also excluded from Full Keyboard Access navigation:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"there is no readable value to expose. When a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"helperText"},{"type":"text","text":" is provided, the helper text is exposed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as accessibility label so the user still understands the context."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Animations are disabled when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibilityReduceMotion"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" or when Low Power Mode is enabled."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Colored surfaces","level":2,"anchor":"Colored-surfaces","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When placed on an ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOColoredSurface","type":"reference"},{"text":", the indicator switches to a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"monochrome","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" rendering, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"status"},{"text":" is ignored.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.2.0 (Figma component design version)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Version"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS 3.0.0"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Since"}]}],"references":{"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOLinearProgressIndicator/body":{"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misolinearprogressindicator\/body","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"body"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"View"}],"title":"body","role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLinearProgressIndicator\/body","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOLinearProgressIndicator/View-Implementations":{